  "decision_date": "03/12/2004",
  "description": "Change of use of upper floor from vacant offices to fitness gymnasium.",
  "site_name": "Ambur House",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "05/12/2004",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW3 1EJ",
  "street_name": "High Street",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "02/12/2009",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed change of use of the upper floor to a fitness gymnasium would provide a sustainable leisure use within Hounslow Town Centre and would not result in an unacceptable loss of employment. The proposal would not harm adjoining businesses or result in conditions harmful to the free flow and safe movement of motorists and pedestrians in the area. The proposal accords with policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), E.1.5 (Development Involving Loss or Changes in Employment), C.5.4\t (New Small Private Sports and Leisure Facilities) and T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities For Developments) of the adopted Unitary Development Plan.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the upper floor is occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - The use shall not commence until a scheme for the ventilation of the premises of an appropriate outlet level, including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant and the standard or dilution expected has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
